        "TileImage": "$($repository bc631938-35c0-47ab-9e62-3bae05920ea7).Image",
        "Description": "Goodnight, 47, and sleep tight. \r\rYou could say that again...\r\rThese two idiots have been trying to broadcast and it has gotten on the nerves of the ICA (for some reason?).\r\rTake them out using a lethal syringe, and a frag grenade. Using these will make a statement.\r\rBeware, the second you make a move armed guards will fire at you, and even though the exits are close by, you need to think carefully.\r\rRecommended: Use 5-shot pistol that can&apos;t be found through frisking. (For extra challenge)",
